&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-left-color:#000000;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;border-right-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:8.5pt;font-size:7.5pt;"&gt;当社補欠監査役（現任）&lt;/p&gt;
